Source: gitcomet
Maintainer: AutoExplore Oy <info@autoexplore.ai>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://gitcomet.dev/

Package: gitcomet
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Depends: git, ${shlibs:Depends}, libvulkan1 | libegl1
